==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Director Kurosawah]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**2 [[R.Ost]]s spawn, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Make sure to have [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]] and a good amount of meatshields, then use a lineup that focuses on Slow or Freeze such as [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] and [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]], rather than damage, as you do not want to push into Kurosawah's range.

Otherwise, bring generic R.Ost counters that can steadily chip at him and the other enemies here without gaining you too much ground, like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]], [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic King Dragon Cat]] and [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Polevaulter Cat]].

==Trivia==
*8K Fertilizer is presumably named after [[wikipedia:8K resolution|8K resolution]], since most [[Singularityville]] stages have technology-related names.

